<title>UK: TABLE-First Choice H1 loss 22.8 mln stg.</title>
<headline>TABLE-First Choice H1 loss 22.8 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half to April 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.1 loss	     vs 7.5 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.9		    vs 1.4</p>
<p> Pretax		     22.8 loss	    vs 23.4 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   373.7		  vs 386.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Current H1 pretax excluded an exceptional charge of 8.6 million stg due to errors in accounting estimates made in prior periods. Including exceptionals, pretax loss was 30.9 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - First Choice Holidays Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
